`requires_project: true` is enforced at the CLI boundary. Pointing `--project` at a vault satisfies
it and the playbook renders; the same playbook invoked from a directory with no marker and no
`--project` exits 1 before any render happens.

`--project` pins discovery to the named vault and drops the global `~/Claude/_playbooks` root, so
the fixture is planted in both roots — the vault copy answers the first invocation, the global copy
the second.

